    "Adds a Guake-style dropdown terminal tab. The terminal session persists across notch open/close cycles.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Guake 스타일의 드롭다운 터미널 탭을 추가합니다. 터미널 세션은 노치를 여닫아도 끊기지 않고 유지됩니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voegt een dropdown-terminaltabblad in Guake-stijl toe. De terminalsessie blijft bestaan ​​gedurende de open/dicht-cycli."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Добавляет выпадающее окно терминала в стиле Guake. Сессия сохраняется."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "เพิ่มแท็บเทอร์มินัลแบบดรอปดาวน์สไตล์ Guake เซสชันเทอร์มินัลจะคงอยู่แม้ปิด/เปิดรอยบาก"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Guake tarzı açılır terminal sekmesi ekler. Terminal oturumu çentik açma/kapama döngüleri boyunca devam eder."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加 Guake 风格的下拉终端标签页。终端会话在刘海开关周期间保持。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds a notch HUD when Caps Lock is enabled, with optional label and tint controls.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Caps Lock이 활성화되면 노치 HUD를 추가합니다. 레이블 및 색조 제어 옵션을 제공합니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voegt een HUD-melding toe wanneer Caps Lock is ingeschakeld, met optionele label- en tintregelaars."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Adiciona um HUD no notch quando o Caps Lock está ativado, com controles opcionais de etiqueta e tonalidade."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Включить выпадающий терминал в стиле Guake. Сессия терминала сохраняется при сворачивании/разворачивании выреза."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "เพิ่ม HUD ที่รอยบากเมื่อเปิด Caps Lock พร้อมป้ายกำกับและการควบคุมสีแบบเลือกได้"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Caps Lock etkinleştirildiğinde isteğe bağlı etiket ve renk tonu kontrolleriyle çentikte bir HUD gösterir."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用 Caps Lock 时添加刘海 HUD，可选标签和着色控制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds the AirPlay/route picker button back to the customizable controls palette.": {
      "localizations": {
        "hu": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AirPlay/경로 선택기 버튼을 사용자 지정 제어기 팔레트에 다시 추가합니다."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AirPlay/경로 선택기 버튼을 사용자 지정 제어기 팔레트에 다시 추가합니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voegt de AirPlay/routekiezerknop weer toe aan het aanpasbare bedieningspalet."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Adiciona o botão AirPlay/seletor de rota de volta à paleta de controles personalizáveis."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Добавляет кнопку AirPlay/выбора маршрута обратно в палитру."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "เพิ่มปุ่ม AirPlay/ตัวเลือกเส้นทางกลับมาที่แผงควบคุมที่ปรับแต่งได้"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AirPlay/rota seçici düğmesini özelleştirilebilir kontrol paletine geri ekler."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将隔空播放/路由选择按钮添加回可自定义的控制面板。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adjust settings above to see changes in real-time. The actual OSD appears at the bottom center of your screen.": {
      "comment": "A footer in the \"Preview\" section of the Custom OSD settings, explaining how to use the live preview feature.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "hu": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "위의 설정을 조정하여 변경 사항을 실시간으로 확인하세요. 실제 OSD는 화면 중앙 하단에 나타납니다."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "위의 설정을 조정하여 변경 사항을 실시간으로 확인하세요. 실제 OSD는 화면 중앙 하단에 나타납니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pas de bovenstaande instellingen aan om wijzigingen in realtime te zien. Het daadwerkelijke OSD verschijnt midden onderaan je scherm."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ajuste as configurações acima para ver as alterações em tempo real. O OSD real aparece na parte inferior central da tela."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Настройте параметры выше. OSD появится внизу по центру."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ปรับการตั้งค้าด้านบนเพื่อดูการเปลี่ยนแปลงแบบเรียลไทม์ OSD จริงจะแสดงที่กลางด้านล่างของหน้าจอ"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Değişiklikleri gerçek zamanlı olarak görmek için yukarıdaki ayarları ayarlayın. Gerçek OSD, ekranınızın alt ortasında görünür."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "调整上方设置即可实时查看变化。实际 OSD 显示在屏幕底部中央。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
