    "Enable the weather capsule and configure its layout, provider, units, and optional battery/AQI indicators.": {
      "comment": "A footer for the \"Weather Widget\" section in the Lock Screen Settings view, describing its purpose.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "날씨 캡슐을 활성화하고 레이아웃, 제공처, 단위 및 선택 사항인 배터리/AQI 표시등을 설정하세요."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Schakel de weercapsule in en configureer de lay-out, provider, eenheden en optionele batterij-/AQI-indicatoren."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ative a cápsula meteorológica e configure seu layout, provedor, unidades e indicadores opcionais de bateria/AQI."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Включить капсулу погоды и настроить её."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "เปิดใช้แคปซูลสภาพอากาศและตั้งค่าเลย์เอาต์ ผู้ให้บริการ หน่วย และตัวบ่งชี้แบตเตอรี่/AQI แบบเลือกได้"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hava kapsülünü etkinleştirin ve düzenini, sağlayıcısını, birimlerini ve isteğe bağlı pil/AQI göstergelerini yapılandırın."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用天气胶囊并配置其布局、数据源、单位和可选的电池/AQI 指示器。"
