    "Enable third-party DDC app integration": {
      "comment": "A toggle switch that enables or disables integration with a third-party Dynamic Display Control (DDC) app. | A toggle switch that enables or disables integration with a third-party Dynamic Display Control (DDC) app. | merge:ko:alt='타사 DDC 앱 통합 활성화'",
