    "Width adjustments apply only to the standard notch layout. Disable Minimalistic UI to edit this value.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "너비 조절은 표준 노치 레이아웃에만 적용됩니다. 이 값을 수정하려면 미니멀리스트 UI를 비활성화하십시오."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Breedteaanpassingen zijn alleen van toepassing op de standaard inkepingsindeling. Schakel de minimalistische gebruikersinterface uit om deze waarde te bewerken."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "การปรับความกว้างใช้เฉพาะเลย์เอาต์รอยบากมาตรฐาน ปิดใช้ UI แบบมินิมอลเพื่อแก้ไขค่านี้"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Genişlik ayarlamaları yalnızca standart çentik düzenine uygulanır. Bu değeri düzenlemek için Minimalist Kullanıcı Arayüzünü devre dışı bırakın."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "宽度调整仅适用于标准刘海布局。禁用简约界面以编辑此值。"
